674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZgtLGR82TOIQ7kNvwGozx3v&_nc_oc=AdpoNLWjxiXXhrodzEZvSWR-pz96_4HHC00bsMqiH7zyCDz7T0O8cd7TUi3W9GlENKY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2wE-qaKIxHt4pLuBI_dWOZSC_ii142PilXJrlZ0-Pwbw&oe=69F367D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gFu6fVhZvQQQ7kNvwEK4vQI&_nc_oc=AdprHaziUZ0hcLlUDBzT25rtYYK5hdb7eOVBi1tnXlbm6CzQHIW7evP1HsvSy5QbBvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0pAkFLsO8jQFYNbnU_ajAn_zzMFR1N9TEfPZD9bN4jAw&oe=69F37096"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ccA30u7GbkUQ7kNvwFnwyay&_nc_oc=AdqFKHirtFIplhoG-RFwSlN3rexfbIlc35r6q__P_FzG2GsMgcOy6Qb5bujn7k00SnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1XPF-l_UXHNP4KNjAtcEic0rRJTJvbI25PBBEvONx30g&oe=69F36CB1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip